Scrolls are different from spellbooks.  You can only write a scroll if you've
seen that scroll before; similarly, you can only write a spellbook if you've
seen that spellbook before.  While it does seem a little brain-dead, spellbooks
of remove curse, identify, magic mapping, etc. would be far to easy
to come by if you could write them knowing only the scroll.

